{%- comment -%}
  PainRelieva — single-page storefront (feature/thermawell).
  Faithful port of the owner-supplied painrelieva HTML mockup, with every
  media placeholder filled from the owner's supplier asset pack. Media were
  CHOSEN, not dumped — each slot follows the LP-template transcript's rule
  ("every element must have a purpose") and the carousel cadence
  hero → in-use demo → objection handler → contents → versatility.

  MEDIA MAP (why each file is where it is):
    pr-hero.jpg                buy-box slot 1 — clean product on white: instantly
                               clear what it is (transcript: "standard hero image").
    pr-video-demo.mp4          buy-box slot 2 — 27s hands-on demo: the in-use /
                               "how it feels" transformation slot.
    pr-fit-measurements.webp   buy-box slot 3 — strap dimensions + extension strap:
                               pre-handles the #1 objection ("will it fit my leg?").
    pr-box-contents.webp       buy-box slot 4 — everything in the box: scale +
                               "this is a real boxed product" reassurance.
    pr-multi-use.jpg           buy-box slot 5 — shoulder/knee/elbow collage:
                               versatility, hits multiple avatars, supports 4-pack.
    pr-in-use-heat.jpg         §identification — warmth radiating on a worn knee:
                               the promised outcome, opposite the failed-fixes copy.
    pr-thermal-deep-heat.jpg   §mechanism — heat reaching deep into the joint.
    pr-mechanism-dual-action.gif §mechanism — animated heat + massage around the
                               kneecap (transcript: "how-it-works with gifs").
    pr-video-fit.mp4           §fit — 32s strapping-on demo: fit + one-button ease.

  DELIBERATELY EXCLUDED supplier assets: everything carrying medical-claim
  overlay text ("relieve rheumatic arthritis", "reduce heart rate", etc.) —
  a direct ASA/CAP §12 ban risk per the owner's own market-research doc —
  plus the 50°C-annotated graphic (conflicts with the page's 60°C claim;
  OWNER: verify the unit's true max temperature before launch), duplicate
  pack shots, and the broken-English-captioned supplier video.

  HONESTY GUARDS (same ethos as the Sajda build — no fake numbers, ever):
    * Pair/Family discount pricing renders ONLY when the "quantity discounts
      are live" checkbox is ticked, so tile prices never contradict checkout.
    * Review count renders only if the owner sets a real number.
    * Founder note renders only when the TRUE story is pasted into settings.
    * The two "do not fill with composite copy" review slots were removed,
      not filled. All four remaining reviews are the verbatim AU ones.
  Buy box binds to the product picked in settings, falling back to handle
  'painrelieva-heated-knee-massager'; until that product exists the CTA
  shows an editor note instead of a dead form.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign lp_product = section.settings.product
  if lp_product == blank
    assign lp_product = all_products['painrelieva-heated-knee-massager']
  endif
  assign lp_variant = lp_product.first_available_variant

  if lp_variant
    assign unit_cents = lp_variant.price
  else
    assign unit_cents = 6900
  endif

  assign x2_cents = unit_cents | times: 2
  assign x4_cents = unit_cents | times: 4
  if section.settings.qty_discounts_live
    assign pair_cents = x2_cents | times: 0.9 | round
    assign fam_cents = x4_cents | times: 0.85 | round
  else
    assign pair_cents = x2_cents
    assign fam_cents = x4_cents
  endif
  assign pair_each = pair_cents | divided_by: 2
  assign fam_each = fam_cents | divided_by: 4

  assign unit_disp = unit_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign pair_disp = pair_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign fam_disp = fam_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign pair_each_disp = pair_each | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign fam_each_disp = fam_each | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign x2_disp = x2_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign x4_disp = x4_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
-%}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#141311;
    --ink-soft:#5d5852;
    --paper:#ffffff;
    --paper-warm:#faf6f1;
    --line:#e6e0d8;
    --ember:#c8500f;
    --ember-tint:#fdeee3;
    --radius-btn:8px;
    --radius-card:12px;
    --maxw:1080px;
    --font-display:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;
    --font-body:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
  }
  #pr-page, #pr-page *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    html{scroll-behavior:auto}
    #pr-page *,#pr-page *::before,#pr-page *::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}
  }
  body{margin:0;background:var(--paper)}
  #pr-page{font-family:var(--font-body);color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);line-height:1.55;font-size:16px}
  #pr-page img,#pr-page svg,#pr-page video{max-width:100%;display:block}
  #pr-page a{color:inherit}
  #pr-page h1,#pr-page h2,#pr-page h3{font-family:var(--font-display);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
  #pr-page h2{font-size:clamp(26px,4.5vw,38px);text-align:center;font-weight:800}
  #pr-page h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--ember)}
  #pr-page .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 18px}
  #pr-page section{padding:56px 0}
  #pr-page .eyebrow{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ember);background:var(--ember-tint);border:1px solid var(--ember);border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;margin-bottom:14px}
  #pr-page .center{text-align:center}
  #pr-page .lede{max-width:640px;margin:14px auto 0;text-align:center;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:17px}

  /* ============ announcement strip ============ */
  #pr-page .announce{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:13px;padding:9px 14px;font-weight:600}
  #pr-page .announce span{color:#f0b48d}

  /* ============ header ============ */
  #pr-page header.pr-head{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(255,255,255,.96);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  #pr-page .header-in{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:58px}
  #pr-page .logo{display:block;text-decoration:none}
  #pr-page .logo img{height:22px;width:auto}
  #pr-page nav.pr-nav{display:flex;gap:22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
  #pr-page nav.pr-nav a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #pr-page nav.pr-nav a:hover,#pr-page nav.pr-nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--ink)}
  #pr-page .cart{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-btn);padding:8px 13px;text-decoration:none}
  @media(max-width:640px){#pr-page nav.pr-nav{display:none}}

  /* ============ buy box ============ */
  #pr-page .buybox{display:grid;gap:34px;padding-top:26px}
  @media(min-width:880px){#pr-page .buybox{grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;align-items:start}}
  #pr-page .gallery-main{aspect-ratio:1/1;width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#f4efe8;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  #pr-page .gallery-main.is-video{aspect-ratio:16/9}
  #pr-page .gallery-main img,#pr-page .gallery-main video{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
  #pr-page .thumbs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:8px}
  #pr-page .thumb{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1/1;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#f4efe8;cursor:pointer;overflow:hidden;padding:0}
  #pr-page .thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
  #pr-page .thumb .t-tag{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:rgba(20,19,17,.62);color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.03em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 3px;text-align:center;line-height:1.25}
  #pr-page .thumb .t-play{position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(20,19,17,.72);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  #pr-page .thumb .t-play::after{content:"";border-style:solid;border-width:6px 0 6px 10px;border-color:transparent transparent transparent #fff;margin-left:2px}
  #pr-page .thumb[aria-pressed="true"]{border:2px solid var(--ember)}
  #pr-page .thumb:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ember);outline-offset:2px}

  #pr-page .trustline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;flex-wrap:wrap}
  #pr-page .stars{color:var(--ember);letter-spacing:2px;font-size:15px}
  #pr-page h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,40px);font-weight:800;margin:10px 0 8px}
  #pr-page h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--ember)}
  #pr-page .subhead{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:17px;margin-bottom:16px}
  #pr-page .bullets{list-style:none;margin:0 0 18px}
  #pr-page .bullets li{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;padding:5px 0;font-size:15.5px}
  #pr-page .bullets svg{flex:none;margin-top:3px}

  #pr-page .price-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:6px 0 14px}
  #pr-page .price-now{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:32px}
  #pr-page .price-note{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}

  /* quantity tiles */
  #pr-page .tiles{display:grid;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px}
  #pr-page .tile{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:12px;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:14px;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;font:inherit;width:100%}
  #pr-page .tile[aria-pressed="true"]{border:2px solid var(--ember);background:var(--ember-tint)}
  #pr-page .tile:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ember);outline-offset:2px}
  #pr-page .tile .radio{width:18px;height:18px;border:2px solid #b9b0a4;border-radius:50%;flex:none}
  #pr-page .tile[aria-pressed="true"] .radio{border-color:var(--ember);background:radial-gradient(circle,var(--ember) 0 45%,transparent 50%)}
  #pr-page .tile .t-label{font-weight:700;font-size:15px}
  #pr-page .tile .t-sub{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #pr-page .tile .t-price{text-align:right}
  #pr-page .tile .t-total{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:18px}
  #pr-page .tile .t-compare{font-size:12.5px;color:#9a9187;text-decoration:line-through}
  #pr-page .ribbon{position:absolute;top:-10px;right:12px;background:var(--ember);color:#fff;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;text-transform:uppercase}

  #pr-page .cta{display:block;width:100%;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:var(--radius-btn);font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:17px;padding:17px;cursor:pointer;text-align:center;text-decoration:none}
  #pr-page .cta:hover{background:#000}
  #pr-page .cta:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ember);outline-offset:2px}
  #pr-page .cta small{display:block;font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:500;font-size:12.5px;opacity:.75;margin-top:2px}
  #pr-page .guarantee-line{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;margin-top:12px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #pr-page .payrow{display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:center;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  #pr-page .payrow span{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 8px;color:var(--ink-soft);letter-spacing:.03em}

  /* ============ benefit icon row ============ */
  #pr-page .icon-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:30px 0}
  @media(min-width:760px){#pr-page .icon-row{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}
  #pr-page .icon-item{text-align:center;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #pr-page .icon-item svg{margin:0 auto 8px}
  #pr-page .icon-item strong{display:block;color:var(--ink);font-size:14.5px;margin-bottom:2px}

  /* ============ empathy / story sections ============ */
  #pr-page .band{background:var(--paper-warm)}
  #pr-page .split{display:grid;gap:30px;align-items:center;margin-top:34px}
  @media(min-width:820px){#pr-page .split{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}#pr-page .split.rev>.split-media{order:2}}
  #pr-page .split h3{font-size:clamp(21px,3vw,27px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:12px}
  #pr-page .split p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:12px;font-size:16px}
  #pr-page .split p strong{color:var(--ink)}
  #pr-page .split-media img,#pr-page .split-media video{width:100%;border-radius:var(--radius-card);border:1px solid var(--line)}

  #pr-page .fig{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:22px}
  #pr-page .fig figcaption{font-size:12.5px;color:#8a8177;text-align:center;margin-top:10px}
  #pr-page .fig.fig-media{padding:0;overflow:hidden}
  #pr-page .fig.fig-media img{width:100%}
  #pr-page .fig.fig-media figcaption{padding:10px 14px 14px}
  #pr-page .media-duo{display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:30px}
  @media(min-width:760px){#pr-page .media-duo{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}

  #pr-page blockquote.pull{border-left:3px solid var(--ember);padding:6px 0 6px 18px;margin:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-style:italic}
  #pr-page blockquote.pull footer{font-style:normal;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:6px;font-weight:600}

  /* ============ comparison table ============ */
  #pr-page .compare-scroll{overflow-x:auto;margin-top:34px;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
  #pr-page table.compare{border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;width:100%;min-width:640px;font-size:14px}
  #pr-page .compare th,#pr-page .compare td{padding:12px 14px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  #pr-page .compare th:first-child,#pr-page .compare td:first-child{text-align:left;font-weight:600;min-width:170px}
  #pr-page .compare thead th{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:13.5px}
  #pr-page .compare .you{background:var(--ember-tint);border-left:2px solid var(--ember);border-right:2px solid var(--ember)}
  #pr-page .compare thead .you{border-top:2px solid var(--ember);border-radius:10px 10px 0 0}
  #pr-page .compare tbody tr:last-child .you{border-bottom:2px solid var(--ember)}
  #pr-page .yes{color:var(--ember);font-weight:800}
  #pr-page .no{color:#b9b0a4;font-weight:700}

  /* ============ reviews ============ */
  /* 2x2 on desktop: four verbatim reviews, no placeholder slots (removed, not filled) */
  #pr-page .reviews{display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:34px}
  @media(min-width:820px){#pr-page .reviews{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
  #pr-page .review{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:20px;background:#fff}
  #pr-page .review .stars{font-size:13px}
  #pr-page .review p{font-size:14.5px;margin:10px 0}
  #pr-page .review footer{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700}
  #pr-page .review footer span{color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:600}
  #pr-page .review .answers{display:inline-block;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ember);background:var(--ember-tint);border-radius:999px;padding:2px 9px}

  /* ============ specs / fit ============ */
  #pr-page .spec-grid{display:grid;gap:14px;margin-top:30px}
  @media(min-width:760px){#pr-page .spec-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
  #pr-page .spec{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:18px;background:#fff;font-size:14px}
  #pr-page .spec strong{display:block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:5px}
  #pr-page .spec span{color:var(--ink-soft)}

  #pr-page .founder{border:1px dashed #c9bfb2;border-radius:var(--radius-card);background:#fff;padding:26px;margin-top:34px}
  #pr-page .founder .tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#8a8177;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px}
  #pr-page .founder p{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:10px}

  #pr-page .gbox{max-width:680px;margin:34px auto 0;border:2px solid var(--ember);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:30px;text-align:center;background:#fff}
  #pr-page .gbox h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px}
  #pr-page .gbox p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:15.5px;margin-bottom:8px}
  #pr-page .gbox .seal{width:64px;height:64px;margin:0 auto 14px;border:2px solid var(--ember);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;color:var(--ember);font-size:13px;line-height:1.1;text-align:center}

  /* ============ FAQ ============ */
  #pr-page .faq{max-width:720px;margin:34px auto 0}
  #pr-page .faq-item{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);margin-bottom:10px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden}
  #pr-page .faq-q{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:none;border:none;font:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:15.5px;text-align:left;padding:17px 18px;cursor:pointer}
  #pr-page .faq-q:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ember);outline-offset:-3px}
  #pr-page .faq-q .pm{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;color:var(--ember);font-size:20px;flex:none}
  #pr-page .faq-a{padding:0 18px 17px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);display:none}
  #pr-page .faq-item.open .faq-a{display:block}

  /* ============ final offer / footer ============ */
  #pr-page .final{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}
  #pr-page .final h2{color:#fff}
  #pr-page .final .lede{color:#c9c2b9}
  #pr-page .final .cta{background:var(--ember);max-width:420px;margin:26px auto 0}
  #pr-page .final .cta:hover{background:#a94209}
  #pr-page .final .guarantee-line{color:#c9c2b9}
  #pr-page footer.site{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:34px 0;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #pr-page .trustbar{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:20px;color:var(--ink)}
  #pr-page .disclaimer{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;line-height:1.6}

  /* ============ sticky bottom bar ============ */
  #pr-page .stickybar{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:60;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 -4px 18px rgba(20,19,17,.08);transform:translateY(110%);transition:transform .25s ease;padding:10px 14px}
  #pr-page .stickybar.show{transform:translateY(0)}
  #pr-page .stickybar-in{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
  #pr-page .stickybar .mini{width:44px;height:44px;flex:none;border-radius:8px;object-fit:cover}
  #pr-page .stickybar .info{flex:1;min-width:0}
  #pr-page .stickybar .info b{display:block;font-size:13.5px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
  #pr-page .stickybar .info span{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #pr-page .stickybar .cta{width:auto;padding:13px 22px;font-size:15px}
  @media(max-width:480px){#pr-page .stickybar .info span em{display:none}}
</style>

<div id="pr-page">

<!-- 1 ▸ ANNOUNCEMENT STRIP -->
<div class="announce">Free UK delivery · <span>30-day home trial</span> · 2-year warranty</div>

<!-- 2 ▸ STICKY HEADER -->
<header class="pr-head">
  <div class="wrap header-in">
    <a class="logo" href="#top" aria-label="PainRelieva home">
      <img src="{{ 'painrelieva-logo.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="PainRelieva" width="158" height="32">
    </a>
    <nav class="pr-nav" aria-label="Main">
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#reviews">Reviews</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="cart" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}">Cart ({{ cart.item_count }})</a>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- 3 ▸ BUY BOX -->
<section id="buy" style="padding-top:10px">
  <div class="wrap buybox" id="top">
    <div>
      <div class="gallery-main" id="galleryMain">
        {%- comment -%} Slot 1 · hero: clean product shot, instantly legible {%- endcomment -%}
        <img src="{{ 'pr-hero.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="PainRelieva heated knee massager wrap with one-button controller" width="900" height="900" fetchpriority="high">
      </div>
      <div class="thumbs" role="group" aria-label="Product photos and video">
        <button class="thumb" aria-pressed="true" data-type="img" data-src="{{ 'pr-hero.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-alt="PainRelieva heated knee massager wrap with one-button controller" aria-label="Photo 1: the wrap">
          <img src="{{ 'pr-hero.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="t-tag">The wrap</span>
        </button>
        <button class="thumb" aria-pressed="false" data-type="video" data-src="{{ 'pr-video-demo.mp4' | asset_url }}" data-poster="{{ 'pr-video-demo-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" aria-label="Video: see it in your hands">
          <img src="{{ 'pr-video-demo-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="t-play" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="t-tag">See it work</span>
        </button>
        <button class="thumb" aria-pressed="false" data-type="img" data-src="{{ 'pr-fit-measurements.webp' | asset_url }}" data-alt="Wrap measurements: 72.8 cm main strap plus 58 cm extension strap for larger legs and swollen knees" aria-label="Photo 3: will it fit? Measurements and extension strap">
