    <div class="split">
      <figure class="fig">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 340 340" role="img" aria-label="The Stiffness Loop: pain leads to less movement, less movement to less circulation, less circulation to a stiffer joint, and a stiffer joint back to more pain.">
